deo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Santa Monica! Experience all the delights that the city has to offer: Explore the picturesque streets at <strong>Old Town</strong> and take a look at the gigantic tire tower that, according to myth, not even the strongest storm can extinguish! Walk the green gardens at <strong>University Point</strong> if you fancy hanging out with people far smarter than you. Or if you feel classy maybe you want to take a look at <strong>Uptown</strong> and its marvelous skyscrapers and malls. You have a historian bone inside you, don't you? Well waste no time and take a look at the famous <strong>Historic quarter</strong> with its colorful monuments at every corner! And to finish your visit spend the night at <strong>Midtown</strong> and its famous chinese corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020020/extras/a78e1be42ed74f8e168a82aedc0aece3.avif?t=1758907646\" width=512 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020020/extras/425abf22cbdb6aa379ff02543d8c3991.poster.avif?t=1758907646\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020020/extras/425abf22cbdb6aa379ff02543d8c3991.webm?t=1758907646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020020/extras/425abf22cbdb6aa379ff02543d8c3991.mp4?t=1758907646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\